參為澅清侯，陰為荻苴侯，唊為平州侯，長［降］為幾侯。最以父死頗有功，為溫陽侯。"}],"source_assertion_id":"a-shiji115-003","interpretation_note":"分支字元不表排行；來源明示父系接線，未名世代以星號保留。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","parent_person_id":"z9d_qn5_wg8"}}],"source_mention_summary":[{"source_id":"table-witness-shiji-020","work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-020","chapter_id":"table-chapter-shiji-020","mention_count":3,"mention_ids":["shiji-020-t1-r073-c01-m001","shiji-020-t1-r073-c06-m000","shiji-020-t1-r073-c07-m000"],"paragraph_ids":[],"table_cell_ids":["shiji-020-t1-r073-c01","shiji-020-t1-r073-c06","shiji-020-t1-r073-c07"],"passage_count":3},{"source_id":"s-shiji115-chaoxian","work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-115","chapter_id":"c-shiji-115-chaoxian","mention_count":2,"mention_ids":["c-shiji-115-chaoxian:m008-0150","c-shiji-115-chaoxian:m008-0198"],"paragraph_ids":["c-shiji-115-chaoxian:p008"],"table_cell_ids":[],"passage_count":1}],"most_mentioned_source_ids":["table-witness-shiji-020"],"mention_count_policy":{"scope":"currently_annotated_mentions","included_kinds":["paragraph","table_cell"],"identity_policy":"contextual_provisional","ties":"all_maxima","frequency_is_not_authority":true},"kinship_interpretation_cases":[],"reported_variants":[],"family_tree_decisions":[],"preferred_relations":[{"id":"a-shiji115-003","subject_person_id":"z9d_qn5_wg8_A","predicate":"father","object_person_id":"z9d_qn5_wg8","status":"source_attested","evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-115-chaoxian","source_id":"s-shiji115-chaoxian","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-115-chaoxian:p008","quote":"左將軍已并兩軍，即急擊朝鮮。朝鮮相路人、相韓陰、尼谿相參、將軍王唊相與謀曰：「始欲降樓船，樓船今執，獨左將軍并將，戰益急，恐不能與，（戰）王又不肯降。」陰、唊、路人皆亡降漢。路人道死。元封三年夏，尼谿相參乃使人殺朝鮮王右渠來降。王險城未下，故右渠之大臣成巳又反，復攻吏。左將軍使右渠子長降、相路人之子最告諭其民，誅成巳，以故遂定朝鮮，為四郡。封參為澅清侯，陰為荻苴侯，唊為平州侯，長［降］為幾侯。最以父死頗有功，為溫陽侯。"}],"qualifiers":{"source_term":"相路人之子最"},"interpretation_note":"明記父子，最為姓名，不作長幼排行。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"family_tree_policy":{"default":"editorial_preferred","original_assertions_preserved":true,"unreviewed_conflicts_may_remain":true,"runtime