_id":"table-chapter-shiji-020","source_id":"table-witness-shiji-020","source_revision":"2607036","kind":"table_person_mention","quote":"三。四年三月壬寅，康侯子最元年。"},{"id":"shiji-020-t1-r073-c07-m000","start":8,"end":9,"surface":"最","person_id":"z9d_qn5_wg8_A","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"同列首封康侯子最及事由路人之子，與本傳最同人；此格明記最死，不由無後國除推死亡。","identity_evidence":[{"work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-115","chapter_id":"c-shiji-115-chaoxian","source_id":"s-shiji115-chaoxian","source_revision":439220,"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-115-chaoxian:p008","person_id":"z9d_qn5_wg8_A","quote":"左將軍已并兩軍，即急擊朝鮮。朝鮮相路人、相韓陰、尼谿相參、將軍王唊相與謀曰：「始欲降樓船，樓船今執，獨左將軍并將，戰益急，恐不能與，（戰）王又不肯降。」陰、唊、路人皆亡降漢。路人道死。元封三年夏，尼谿相參乃使人殺朝鮮王右渠來降。王險城未下，故右渠之大臣成巳又反，復攻吏。左將軍使右渠子長降、相路人之子最告諭其民，誅成巳，以故遂定朝鮮，為四郡。封參為澅清侯，陰為荻苴侯，唊為平州侯，長［降］為幾侯。最以父死頗有功，為溫陽侯。"}],"table_id":"shiji-020","table_fragment_id":"shiji-020-digital-table-1","table_row_id":"shiji-020-t1-r073","table_cell_id":"shiji-020-t1-r073-c07","work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-020","chapter_id":"table-chapter-shiji-020","source_id":"table-witness-shiji-020","source_revision":"2607036","kind":"table_person_mention","quote":"二。太初二年，侯最死，無後，國除。"}],"date_range_normalizations":[{"earliest":{"era":"BCE","era_year":103,"year":-102},"latest":{"era":"BCE","era_year":102,"year":-101},"year_numbering":"astronomical","precision":"year_range","basis":"regnal_year_crosses_ce_year","status":"editorial_provisional","original_quote":"二。太初二年，侯最死，無後，國除。","evidence":[{"kind":"table_cell","table_id":"shiji-020","table_cell_id":"shiji-020-t1-r073-c07","person_mention_id":"shiji-020-t1-r073-c07-m000","quote":"二。太初二年，侯最死，無後，國除。","work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-020","chapter_id":"table-chapter-shiji-020","source_id":"table-witness-shiji-020","source_revision":"2607036"}],"references":[{"title":"《史記·孝武本紀》改歲首","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=史記/卷012&oldid=8733061","quote":"夏，漢改歷，以正月為歲首，而色上黃，官名更印章以五字。因為太初元年。是歲，西伐大宛。蝗大起。丁夫人、雒陽虞初等以方祠詛匈奴、大宛焉。","scope":"received_calendar_rul